PX Password Strength (visual overlay for Roundcube password plugin)
===============================================================

This plugin adds a live password strength bar and a requirements checklist
to the default Roundcube `password` plugin form in:

- Settings -> Password (`?_task=settings&_action=plugin.password`)

It is a visual overlay only. Server-side validation is still handled by the
Roundcube `password` plugin and its configured driver.

Installation
------------

1. Enable plugin in `config/config.inc.php` after `password`:

   $config['plugins'] = [..., 'password', 'px_password_strength'];

2. Copy config template (optional):

   cp plugins/px_password_strength/config.inc.php.dist plugins/px_password_strength/config.inc.php

Notes
-----

- The overlay reads `password_minimum_length` from the `password` plugin config.
- Checklist items (lower/upper/digit/special/diacritics) are configurable in
  `plugins/px_password_strength/config.inc.php`.
- By default, the native `password` plugin rules list is hidden to avoid
  duplicate UI (`px_password_strength_hide_native_rules = true`).
